  "body": [
    "Home",
    "Valtech Innovation Marathon 2027",
    "The Innovation Marathon is a program where Valtech experts and a select group of clients come together to explore what’s possible with AI. It’s hands-on, collaborative, and focused on building something real—a working proof of concept that addresses a live business challenge.",
    "You won’t be going it alone. Along the way, you'll work with peers, learn from subject matter experts, and shape a solution that’s grounded in your priorities.",
    "Previous participants include The Greenery, ERIKS, Hoya, Lely Industries, Salta Group and The Social Hub.",
    "This program is built for teams who want to innovate, but don’t want to hit pause on the day-to-day. If you’re already thinking about how AI fits into your roadmap, this is a space to make progress quickly, with the right support.",
    "Looking to improve customer experience, unlock new efficiencies or create smarter workflows with AI.",
    "Keen to explore AI in a modular, scalable way — without disrupting existing systems.",
    "Ready to turn ideas into action, learn through doing, and connect with others solving similar challenges.",
    "Keep me informed",
    "A proof of concept you can stand behindYou’ll leave with a working prototype that solves a real problem in your business.",
    "An experience-led approach to AITogether we’ll explore how AI supports your broader strategy, not just a single use case.",
    "A stronger networkYou’ll collaborate with clients and colleagues across industries who are asking the same questions you are.",
    "A clear path forwardWhether you choose to scale your solution or explore another idea, you’ll know exactly what the next step looks like.",
    "The program is structured around five key moments, designed to keep momentum high and effort manageable.",
    "Kick-off (onsite): define your challenge, shape your ambition, and get to work",
    "Kick-off (onsite): define your challenge, shape your ambition, and get to work",
    "Milestone 1: review your solution design with the group",
    "Milestone 1: review your solution design with the group",
    "Milestone 2: share your progress and refine your approach",
    "Milestone 2: share your progress and refine your approach",
    "Milestone 3: prepare your concept for demo",
    "Milestone 3: prepare your concept for demo",
    "Grand Finale (onsite): pitch your solution, share your results, and connect with new stakeholders",
    "Grand Finale (onsite): pitch your solution, share your results, and connect with new stakeholders",
    "Keep me informed",
    "The program is built around your roadmap, not outside it",
    "The program is built around your roadmap, not outside it",
    "It’s designed to be lightweight, but high impact",
    "It’s designed to be lightweight, but high impact",
    "And it works — many clients go on to implement or scale their POCs",
    "And it works — many clients go on to implement or scale their POCs",
    "If you’re ready to explore what AI can unlock for your team, keep in touch and we’ll let you know when more details about Innovation Marathon 2027 are available."
  ],
